  "notes": "- \uD83C\uDFE2 Katta filial bazalari ham ishlaydi: 250 MB\u002B baza (1,3 mln\u002B amal) xotira yetmay to\u0027xtab qolmaydi \u2014 nusxa oqim bilan tayyorlanadi\r\n- \uD83D\uDCBE Dastur endi kompyuter xotirasidan to\u0027liqroq foydalanadi (2 GB o\u0027rniga 4 GB gacha) \u2014 katta bazalar va ko\u0027p filial uchun\r\n- \uD83D\uDCE6 Filial bazasi hajmi, amallar soni, yuborilgan paket va bu kompyuterdagi nusxa hajmi ko\u0027rinadi\r\n- \u2B07 Filial ma\u0027lumoti kelayotganda: necha MB keldi, tezlik va qancha vaqt qolgani (jarayon chizig\u0027i bilan)\r\n- \uD83C\uDFE2 Filial ma\u0027lumoti hali kelmagan bo\u0027lsa \u2014 bo\u0027sh sahifa o\u0027rniga jarayon kartochkasi; filial yuborayotganda har daqiqada tekshiriladi\r\n- \uD83D\uDCC1 Filiallar ma\u0027lumoti saqlanadigan papka ko\u0027rinadi va boshqa diskka ko\u0027chirish mumkin (Sozlamalar \u2192 \uD83C\uDF10 Onlayn)\r\n- \u2728 Filial tanlash oynasi yangilandi: holat, aloqa vaqti, hajm va yuklanish jarayoni bilan\r\n- \u2728 Filialdan filialga o\u0027tish silliq animatsiya bilan\r\n- \uD83C\uDFE2 Yangi alohida dastur \u0022Loonar Filial\u0022 \u2014 filial (do\u0027kon) kompyuteriga o\u0027rnatiladi, faqat ma\u0027lumot yuboradi\r\n- \uD83C\uDFE2 Loonar Filial: baza, filial nomi va asosiy Hisobot ID si kiritiladi \u2192 \u0022So\u0027rov yuborish\u0022 \u2192 asosiy Hisobotda qabul qilinadi\r\n- \uD83C\uDFE2 Loonar Filial Windows bilan birga o\u0027zi ishga tushadi va soat yonida fonda ishlaydi \u2014 oyna yopilsa ham yuboraveradi\r\n- \uD83C\uDFE2 Filial oynasida holat ko\u0027rinadi: qabul kutilmoqda / ulangan, oxirgi yuborish vaqti\r\n- \uD83C\uDFE2 Loonar Filial sozlamalari alohida saqlanadi \u2014 bir kompyuterda Hisobot bilan birga o\u0027rnatilsa ham Hisobot sozlamasiga tegmaydi\r\n- \u23F1 Qabul qilingandan keyin ma\u0027lumot 2 daqiqa ichida yuborila boshlaydi\r\n- \uD83C\uDF10 Boshqaruvda onlayn kanalni tekshirish: bot kanalda bormi, admin-mi, huquqlari yetarlimi \u2014 aniq ko\u0027rsatadi",
